From 87a116b24ca28969af6ab8494471daf619d56261 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Tristan=20M=C3=B5ts?= <tristan@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:40:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 04/18] feat(admin): rework host scoring console

- sticky score bar: team totals, strike pips, pot/banked state, x1/x2/x3 multiplier
- answer grid with readable revealed/clean-up states (fixes white-on-grey text)
- team-coloured strike and award buttons with a clear 'banked' state + steal hint
- two-step confirm on Title Card / Start Round 1 when a game is in progress
- compact room header and collapsible settings during play so the board
  controls fit above the fold at 1440x900
- team1/team2 accent colours and fast money defaults in the theme config
---
